Co-regulation modifies the Master Evolution Equation:
\[
\frac{d\mathbf{X}}{dt} =
\mathbf{F}(\mathbf{X}, t)
+
\mathbf{K}(\mathbf{X})\Gamma(t).
\]

This ensures:
\begin{itemize}
    \item UFSL forcing is continuity-modulated,
    \item identity preservation influences latent-force contraction,
